OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to murder of
OL,4,Apensioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to the
OL,7,Fmurder of a pensioner in County Tyrone.
OL,9,FAdam Krzan was found dead in his flat
OL,10,Fin Dungannon in February 2025.
OL,12,FThe 71-year-old, who was originally
OL,13,Ffrom Poland but had lived in Northern
OL,14,FIreland for more than 20 years, was
OL,15,Ffound by police with multiple stab
OL,16,Fwounds at his flat in the Lisnahull
OL,17,Farea of Dungannon. He died as a result
OL,18,Fof his injuries.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
