OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to murder of
OL,4,Apensioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyan Patrick Kerr, 34, of Derrylattinee
OL,7,FRoad in Dungannon, appeared at
OL,8,FLaganside Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,9,Fwhere he denied the charge.
